	"desc": "Path meter for branching finals (scripts/core/evo_path.gd; briefs/design/GARDEN_MODERN.md section 3; docs/decisions/0022). Lines are keyed by species id. Each end: form id (art at art/kin/<form>/<form>.glb, missing = the Boki waits), path (the affinity of its path tokens, garden_items.json), stat (its key stat, Care.STATS), type (its second type, lean.json), traits (any at trait_at or more gives a care pip), sports (games whose Cup Ribbons count, garden_prizes.json ids). level: the level the final is due. The end with more pips wins; tie: the stat lead; still tied: undecided.",
